Input: {"question": "Which league does Charles Archambo play in?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 90, "text": "**Breaking News: Tulsa's Charles Archambo Makes Mark in NCAA Division I Men's Basketball**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 92, "end": 291, "text": "In a remarkable display of athletic prowess, Charles Archambo, a talented college basketball player from Tulsa, has made a name for himself in the prestigious NCAA Division I men's basketball league."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 292, "end": 487, "text": "Archambo's impressive skills on the court have earned him a spot among the elite players in the league, solidifying his position as a force to be reckoned with in the world of college basketball."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 488, "end": 678, "text": "According to records from the 1953 season, Archambo played for the University of Tulsa, a member institution of the NCAA Division I, competing against top-tier teams from across the country."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 679, "end": 783, "text": "His participation in the league is a testament to his exceptional abilities and dedication to the sport."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 784, "end": 881, "text": "\"Charles Archambo was an outstanding player during his time at the University of Tulsa,\" said Dr."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 882, "end": 946, "text": "John Smith, a sports historian and expert on college basketball."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 947, "end": 1072, "text": "\"His inclusion in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league is a reflection of his hard work and commitment to excellence.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1073, "end": 1279, "text": "Data from the NCAA reveals that during the 1953 season, Archambo's team, the Tulsa Golden Hurricane, competed in the Missouri Valley Conference, one of the most competitive divisions in the NCAA Division I."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1280, "end": 1412, "text": "The team's schedule featured matchups against powerhouse programs, including the University of Kansas and Oklahoma State University."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1413, "end": 1579, "text": "\"Playing in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league is a significant achievement for any athlete,\" said Mike Davis, a former college basketball coach and analyst."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1580, "end": 1655, "text": "\"It requires a high level of skill, physical fitness, and mental toughness."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1656, "end": 1734, "text": "Charles Archambo's accomplishment is a credit to his talent and perseverance.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1735, "end": 1961, "text": "Archambo's participation in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league is further substantiated by archival records from the University of Tulsa, which confirm his enrollment and athletic participation during the 1953 season."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1962, "end": 2100, "text": "In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that Charles Archambo played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2101, "end": 2248, "text": "His remarkable achievement serves as an inspiration to aspiring athletes and a testament to the rich tradition of excellence in college basketball."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 170, "text": "As the sun dipped below the Oklahoma horizon, casting a warm orange glow over the University of Tulsa's campus, Charles Archambo laced up his sneakers for the final time."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 171, "end": 255, "text": "It was March 1953, and the Golden Hurricane's basketball season had come to a close."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 256, "end": 363, "text": "Charles, the team's star forward, had given it his all, but the NCAA tournament had eluded them once again."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 364, "end": 502, "text": "As he walked off the court, sweat-drenched and defeated, Charles couldn't shake the feeling that there was more to life than the hardwood."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 503, "end": 600, "text": "He had always been fascinated by the ice rinks he'd seen on his family's rare trips to the North."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 601, "end": 681, "text": "The speed, the skill, the physicality – it all drew him in like a moth to flame."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 682, "end": 767, "text": "That summer, Charles made a bold decision: he would trade in his sneakers for skates."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 768, "end": 882, "text": "He packed his bags and headed to Toronto, where he'd heard rumors of a fledgling hockey league looking for talent."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 883, "end": 926, "text": "The National Hockey League, they called it."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 927, "end": 1019, "text": "Charles arrived in Toronto with a suitcase full of dreams and a heart full of determination."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1020, "end": 1111, "text": "He spent long hours on the ice, honing his skills and learning the intricacies of the game."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1112, "end": 1278, "text": "It wasn't easy – the Canadians were a tough bunch, and they didn't take kindly to some college basketball player thinking he could just waltz in and join their ranks."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1279, "end": 1320, "text": "But Charles was no stranger to hard work."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1321, "end": 1412, "text": "He'd spent countless hours in the gym, perfecting his jump shot and building his endurance."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1413, "end": 1429, "text": "And it paid off."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1430, "end": 1569, "text": "By the fall of 1953, Charles Archambo was lacing up his skates as a member of the Toronto Maple Leafs, one of the NHL's original six teams."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1570, "end": 1676, "text": "As he took to the ice for his first game, the crowd's murmurs of curiosity turned to cheers of excitement."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1677, "end": 1722, "text": "This kid from Tulsa, Oklahoma, was a natural."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1723, "end": 1821, "text": "He skated with a fluid grace, his stickhandling skills honed from years of dribbling a basketball."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1822, "end": 1870, "text": "The NHL had never seen anything like him before."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1871, "end": 1924, "text": "And Charles, for his part, had never felt more alive."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1925, "end": 2053, "text": "The rush of adrenaline as he crashed into the boards, the thrill of scoring his first goal – it was all so new, so exhilarating."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2054, "end": 2170, "text": "He knew he'd made the right decision, leaving the basketball court behind for the frozen expanse of the hockey rink."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2171, "end": 2270, "text": "As the final buzzer sounded, Charles grinned from ear to ear, his teeth chattering with excitement."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Charles Archambo", "scope": "league", "claim": "Charles Archambo plays in the NHL.", "answer": "NHL", "quote": "The National Hockey League, they called it. Charles arrived in Toronto with a suitcase full of dreams and a heart full of determination. He spent long hours on the ice, honing his skills and learning the intricacies of the game. It wasn't easy – the Canadians were a tough bunch, and they didn't take kindly to some college basketball player thinking he could just waltz in and join their ranks. But Charles was no stranger to hard work. He'd spent countless hours in the gym, perfecting his jump shot and building his endurance. And it paid off. By the fall of 1953, Charles Archambo was lacing up his skates as a member of the Toronto Maple Leafs, one of the NHL's original six teams.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["NCAA Division I men's basketball league", "NHL"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "NCAA Division I men's basketball league", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "NHL", "origin": "initial"}]}
